  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Command 8 (Disc): the centre comes from $1168, the size from shape_drag_size and the place from shape_drag_move. Then it fills the shape in current_colour ($3beb) with brush 0 ($1868) and puts brush_ptr back."},
    {"at":42,"placement":"side","text":"brush 0 for the fill"},
    {"at":63,"placement":"line","text":"Command 5 (Circle): the centre comes from $1168, the size from shape_drag_size and the place from shape_drag_move. Then it draws the circle in current_colour ($3bcc)."},
    {"at":106,"placement":"line","text":"Sets the size of a circle: the second point (shape_x1, shape_y1) follows the cursor, and $3b85 draws the band circle again at each move (a second draw removes it). A press removes the band circle and returns. A long press with no touch removes the return address of the caller, puts current_colour back from saved_colour and goes back to the menu ($1495)."},
    {"at":178,"placement":"line","text":"Moves a circle: keeps shape_x0 - shape_x1 in delta_x and shape_y0 - shape_y1 in delta_y. Then the second point follows the cursor and the centre moves with it, in the limits 0-cursor_limit_x and 0-cursor_limit_y. $3b85 draws the band circle again at each move. A press removes the band circle and returns. A long press with no touch goes back to the menu ($1495)."},
    {"at":206,"placement":"side","text":"delta_x = shape_x0 - shape_x1 (16 bits)"},
    {"at":242,"placement":"side","text":"delta_y = shape_y0 - shape_y1 (16 bits)"},
    {"at":320,"placement":"side","text":"shape_x0 = shape_x1 + delta_x"}
  ],
